cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  The Finite Volume Method for the One-Dimensional Euler Equations
message: "If you use this software or the accompanying report, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Nông
    given-names: Thanh Toàn
  - family-names: Nguyễn
    given-names: Hoàng Tú
  - family-names: Lê
    given-names: Minh Tuấn Kiệt
  - family-names: Đặng
    given-names: Kim Bảng
abstract: >-
  A verified finite-volume solver for the one-dimensional Euler equations:
  an exact Riemann solver, Lax-Friedrichs / local Lax-Friedrichs / HLL / HLLC
  fluxes, MUSCL reconstruction with TVD limiters, SSP Runge-Kutta time
  integration, and a grid-convergence study confirming the design order of
  each scheme.
keywords:
  - computational fluid dynamics
  - finite volume method
  - Euler equations
  - Riemann solver
  - shock tube
